  "summary": "All 538 tests pass. Added `POST /api/v1/folder-tags` so TENANT_ADMIN/CONTRACT_OWNER can create new folder/tag definitions (previously the `folder_tags` table had no insert path at all — only list and per-contract assign existed, so tagging was unusable with an empty table). Validates name/kind, enforces uniqueness (409 on duplicate name+kind), matches existing `FOLDER`/`TAG` kind convention from the codebase's tests, and returns the existing `FolderTagOptionResponse` shape.",
